  title: NOT ENOUGH BAMBOO!
  description: "The weather is nice here on the mountain! \n\nThe temperature is
    just right for the panda, but there's a problem. The panda eats a lot of bamboo,
    and there is not enough for the panda here.\n\nShould the panda move somewhere
    else or stay on the mountain?  "
